By handling the error, do you mean adding an error message?

E.g.

```rust
match stdout.read_line(&mut line) {
  Ok(0) => break,
  Err(err) => {
    debug!(action = "stdout"; "Err: {}", err);
    continue;
  },
  _ => (),
}
```

(which will print: `Err: stream did not contain valid UTF-8`)

Or something else?

```rust
match stdout.read_line(&mut line) {
  Ok(0) => break,
  Ok(_) => {
    debug!(action = "stderr"; "{}", &line[0..line.len() - 1]); 
    lines.extend(line.as_bytes().to_vec()); 
  },
  _ => (),
}
```
